CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'fs_info->pidonly == PROC_PIDONLY_ON'
#84: FILE: fs/proc/proc_net.c:276:
+	if (net && (fs_info->pidonly == PROC_PIDONLY_ON) &&
+	    security_capable(fs_info->mounter_cred, net->user_ns, CAP_NET_ADMIN, CAP_OPT_NONE) < 0) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

